---
import { FileText, ArrowUpRight, BookOpen, Shield, GitPullRequest } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section id="resources" class="py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
    <span className="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-blue-900 bg-blue-100 border border-blue-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
      Open Source & Public Blueprints
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mt-3">
      Open Curriculum & Governance Files
    </h2>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
      Unlike opaque societies, our full curriculum, workshop slides, community bylaws, and institutional frameworks are open-sourced on GitHub.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
    <a
      href="https://github.com/uos-entrepreneurship/.github/blob/main/WORKSHOP_SERIES_GIT_ZERO_TO_HERO.md"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-slate-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-800 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          <BookOpen class="w-5 h-5" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-blue-900 font-bold block mb-1">
          Technical Syllabus
        </span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors">
          Git: Ground Zero to First PR
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Complete 2-hour lesson plan detailing local config, SSH keys, feature branching, and pull request workflows.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-blue-900 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100">
        <span>Inspect Blueprint</span>
        <ArrowUpRight class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
      </div>
    </a>

    <a
      href="https://github.com/uos-entrepreneurship/.github/blob/main/CAMPUS_EXPERT_PORTFOLIO.md"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-slate-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          <FileText class="w-5 h-5" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-amber-900 font-bold block mb-1">
          Institutional Portfolio
        </span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2 group-hover:text-amber-900 transition-colors">
          Campus Expert Framework
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          12-month impact metrics, campus challenge analysis, and vision documentation for GitHub Campus accreditation.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-amber-900 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100">
        <span>Read Framework</span>
        <ArrowUpRight class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
      </div>
    </a>

    <a
      href="https://github.com/uos-entrepreneurship/.github/blob/main/.github/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-slate-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-50 text-purple-800 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          <Shield class="w-5 h-5" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-purple-900 font-bold block mb-1">
          Governance Bylaw
        </span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2 group-hover:text-purple-900 transition-colors">
          Community Code of Conduct
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Institutional conduct pledge ensuring an inclusive, beginner-friendly, and professional environment for all members.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-purple-900 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100">
        <span>View Standards</span>
        <ArrowUpRight class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
      </div>
    </a>

    <a
      href="https://github.com/uos-entrepreneurship/.github/blob/main/.github/CONTRIBUTING.md"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-slate-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          <GitPullRequest class="w-5 h-5" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-emerald-900 font-bold block mb-1">
          Contribution Guide
        </span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-900 transition-colors">
          Developer Guidelines
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Instructions for student contributors: branch naming, conventional commits, and submitting pull requests.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-emerald-900 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100">
        <span>Read Guidelines</span>
        <ArrowUpRight class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
